{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>It shall be stoned</b> — twice in the Masorah: here, and the other: סקול יסקל השור (the ox shall be stoned). We learn for generations from here: just as here by pushing away and by stoning, so too for generations pushing away and stoning. If beast or man, it shall not live. In cursing, one begins from the small:" "<b>When drawn out</b> — twice in the Masorah: here, and the other: במשוך בקרן היובל (when drawing out with the horn of the jubilee), for there too it happened to them a shofar from the ram of Isaac, and in the merit of this shofar of the giving of Torah, the wall of Jericho fell:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:38.323653437Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}